      <div class="intro-center"><div class="small-cross">✛</div><p>THE CAMERA REVEALS<br/>WHAT THE EYE CANNOT.</p><h1>LONG<br/><em>EXPOSURE</em></h1><div class="title-rule"></div><h2>GHOST HUNT</h2></div>
